{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-18 22:50:00', 'title': 'U.S. BANCORP SHAREHOLDER ALERT: CLAIMSFILER REMINDS INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $100,000 OF LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST U.S. BANCORP - USB', 'text': 'NEW ORLEANS , NOV. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CLAIMSFILER, A FREE SHAREHOLDER INFORMATION SERVICE, REMINDS INVESTORS THAT THEY HAVE UNTIL DECEMBER 27, 2022 TO FILE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPLICATIONS IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST U.S. BANCORP (NYSE: USB), IF THEY PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). \xa0THIS ACTION IS PENDING IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-18 15:50:00', 'title': 'U.S. BANCORP CLASS ACTION: LEVI & KORSINSKY REMINDS U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS OF THE PENDING CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT WITH A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF DECEMBER 27, 2022 - USB', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 18, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANCORP" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: USB) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN U.S. BANCORP SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-18 09:23:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ACTION ALERT: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM FILES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP AND ADVISES SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 18, 2022) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANK" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE: USB) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-18 05:45:00', 'title': 'USB SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS U.S. BANCORP SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF DECEMBER 27, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK , NOV. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF U.S. BANCORP (NYSE: USB). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/U-S-BANCORP-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=33823&FROM=4 THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES FOR SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED U.S. BANCORP BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND\xa0JULY 28, 2022.'}